    <selectionEntry id="11e9-830f-f26c-1de1" name="Chaos Trolls" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <rules>
        <rule id="2da6-b52d-788f-5ed9" name="Troll Vomit" hidden="false">
          <description>A Troll&apos;s digestive fluid is the most corrosive thing known to science... and about the most revolting too. Trolls are able to vomit their stomach contents upon their enemies if they wish. A unit of Trolls can make Vomit Attacks instead of ordinary attacks during close combat.

Instead of attacking normally the whole unit may elect to vomit on the enemy. As each Troll can make only 1 Vomit Attack at a time, as opposed to 3 ordinary Attacks, this means the unit gets fewer Attacks, although these always hit. Each model inflicts one automatic Strength 5 hit with no Armour saves allowed.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="91c1-6135-d11d-5d69" name="Regenerate" hidden="false" targetId="7c7c-8683-ae17-d576" type="rule"/>
        <infoLink id="c47a-c41d-4a34-e811" name="Stupidity" hidden="false" targetId="6c1b-2f0f-d172-01ca" type="rule"/>
