    <selectionEntry id="a5d3-fe46-0650-d7f8" name="Tzeentch&apos;s Will" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <modifiers>
        <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
          <conditions>
            <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="19d9-f7ab-4148-310e" type="equalTo"/>
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <constraints>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="3a57-77b1-b3a5-c36a" type="max"/>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="c0f8-d01f-26a9-19a0" type="max"/>
      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="8e50-e6e5-83a7-8b06" name="Tzeentch&apos;s Will" hidden="false">
          <description>The Daemon may re-roll a single D6 once per turn. The re-roll entitle the player to take a single D6 (including one of the dice rolled as part of a 2D6, 3D6, etc) and roll it again. Any D6 can be re-rolled and can potentially cause Irresistible Force or avoid a Miscast. Remember that you cannot re-roll a dice more than once.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="ce5d-29af-3f9a-8ec1" name="Daemonic Gift" hidden="false" targetId="d855-0137-fb0f-b91c" primary="false"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="eaa7-6800-e651-8bea" value="75.0"/>
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry id="105d-58b5-6a3a-9f68" name="Spell Destroyer" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <modifiers>
        <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
          <conditions>
            <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="19d9-f7ab-4148-310e" type="equalTo"/>
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <constraints>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="62b7-6198-8068-ac52" type="max"/>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="8eb4-7d9a-a0ce-78b4" type="max"/>
      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="ed6a-3698-f700-2582" name="Spell Destroyer" hidden="false">
          <description>The Daemon can wrench magical power from its foes using its own Chaos essence to attack the minds of enemy Wizards.

Once per battle, the Daemon may automatically dispel one enemy spell, except one which has just been cast with Irresistible Force. In addition, roll a D6. On a roll of 4+, the enemy Wizard loses knowledge of that spell and may not cast it for the rest of the battle.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="483c-8785-a51a-5460" name="Daemonic Gift" hidden="false" targetId="d855-0137-fb0f-b91c" primary="false"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="eaa7-6800-e651-8bea" value="50.0"/>
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
